        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "NOTE 1 For example, if the requested charge power for a time segment within the EVPowerProfile is 20 kW and PowerTolerance is set to 1.5 kW, the acceptable PowerTolerance band for charging during that segment is (18.5 - 21.5) kW.",
